 <h3><u>Zainab ka naam musalle par</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Haye ali, haye ali, haye ali..(2)<br> Haye ali, haye ali<br> haye ali, maula ali</p> 
  <p>Ro roke ali kyu lete hain zainab ka naam musalle par..(2)</p> 
  <p>Kya yaad ali ko aaya hai bazaar e shaam musalle par<br> Ro roke ali kyu lete hain zainab ka naam musalle par..(2)</p> 
  <p>1. Khoo'n jaari tha zakhmi sar se<br> rote the namazi saff mein khade<br> kis tarha hasan ne ro ro kar<br> ki fajr tamaam musalle par</p> 
  <p>Ro roke ali kyu lete hain zainab ka naam musalle par..(2)</p> 
  <p>2. Kya maa ki tarha lene tumko<br> masjid mein chali aaye zainab<br> baba ko jaakar dedo fizza<br> mera paigham musalle par</p> 
  <p>Ro roke ali kyu lete hain zainab ka naam musalle par..(2)</p> 
  <p>3. Haaye,<br> Zakhmi pehlu jab yaad aaya<br> zakhmi peshani bhool gaya<br> zahra ki museebat par roya<br> mazloom imam musalle par</p> 
  <p>Ro roke ali kyu lete hain zainab ka naam musalle par..(2)</p> 
  <p>4. Ye pehli fajr hai zainab ki<br> sajde mein sukoo'n milta hai nahi<br> dil doobta hai aata hi nahi<br> ik pal aaraam musalle par</p> 
  <p>Ro roke ali kyu lete hain zainab ka naam musalle par..(2)</p> 
  <p>5. Deewar e kaaba baith gayi<br> al-hamd lahu mein doob gayi<br> ummat se mila hai maula ko<br> kaisa in'aam musalle par</p> 
  <p>Ro roke ali kyu lete hain zainab ka naam musalle par..(2)</p> 
  <p>6. Us ghairat daar ki ghurbat par<br> roti hai ali ki ghurbat bhi<br> chalees baras jo kehta raha<br> ash-shaam ash-shaam musalle par</p> 
  <p>Ro roke ali kyu lete hain zainab ka naam musalle par..(2)</p> 
  <p>7. Shabbir ki janib se akbar<br> qatil ko pilaya tha sharbat<br> jab yaad ali ko aaya tha<br> ek tashna kaam musalle par</p> 
  <p>Ro roke ali kyu lete hain zainab ka naam musalle par..(2)</p> 
  <p>Haye ali, haye ali<br> haye ali, maula ali</p> 
